1
00:00:00,082 --> 00:00:03,422
Seems like a bit of a letdown
after our lichen conversation, but...

2
00:00:03,585 --> 00:00:05,335
What do you know? You're haIf-swan.

3
00:00:07,005 --> 00:00:08,635
l did some research on strippers.

4
00:00:08,799 --> 00:00:11,089
One agency said
they can get us a great price...

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:14,680
(Raj:)...if we're flexible on age range
and number of limbs.

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,730
(Howard:)Sounds like loads of fun,
but I promised Bernadette no strippers.

7
00:00:19,893 --> 00:00:22,853
Heh, you don't want strippers?
You're the king of strippers.

8
00:00:23,021 --> 00:00:26,231
That one club in North Hollywood
named a pole after you.

9
00:00:27,317 --> 00:00:28,397
What can I tell you?

10
00:00:28,569 --> 00:00:31,609
- I'm not into that stuff anymore.
- Good. I'm proud of you.

11
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:35,200
You're the first of us to get married.
We have to do something special.

12
00:00:35,409 --> 00:00:38,039
(Sheldon:)Germans have an interesting
pre-wedding custom...

13
00:00:38,245 --> 00:00:40,415
(Howard:)It's probably not for me.

14
00:00:43,834 --> 00:00:47,124
Maybe we can go up to, uh, Napa Valley.
They've got that wine train...

15
00:00:47,379 --> 00:00:50,969
Boo, wine. But, yay, trains. I'm in.

16
00:00:51,592 --> 00:00:54,012
(Raj:)Anyway, it's a beautiful time of year.

17
00:00:54,178 --> 00:00:58,518
(Raj:)You travel through the vineyards, there's
a tasting on board, and all the wildflowers...

18
00:00:58,682 --> 00:01:01,102
(Raj:)...are in bloom. It's magic.

19
00:01:02,477 --> 00:01:09,027
Look at that. Ln 30 seconds,
we went from hiring women to being them.

